T*
(              STRATONODE CLOUDCORE ? SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(                    DOCUMENT ID: QH-STRATO-2026-SLA) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Service Level Agreement \("SLA"\) is incorporated by reference into the) Tj
T*
(Cloud Service Agreement between StratoNode Inc. \("Provider"\) and Quillhub Inc.) Tj
T*
(\("Customer"\) dated August 1, 2026 \(Contract ID: QH-STRATO-2026-001, the) Tj
T*
("Agreement"\). Capitalized terms not defined in this SLA have the meanings) Tj
T*
(given in the Agreement or the Standard Terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In the event of a conflict between this SLA and the Agreement, this SLA) Tj
T*
(controls with respect to uptime commitments and service credits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1 ? DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
(------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.1  "Monthly Uptime Percentage" means the total number of minutes in a) Tj
T*
(     calendar month minus the number of Downtime Minutes, divided by the total) Tj
T*
(     number of minutes in that calendar month, expressed as a percentage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.2  "Downtime Minutes" means the total number of minutes during which the) Tj
T*
(     Cloud Service is unavailable, excluding Scheduled Maintenance and any) Tj
T*
(     unavailability caused by circumstances described in Section 5.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.3  "Scheduled Maintenance" means maintenance that Provider has notified) Tj
T*
(     Customer about at least 48 hours in advance via email to the Customer's) Tj
T*
(     Operations contact or through the Provider's status page. Scheduled) Tj
T*
(     Maintenance windows will not exceed four \(4\) hours per occurrence and) Tj
T*
(     will not be scheduled more than twice per calendar month.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.4  "Service Credit" means a credit against future Fees, calculated as) Tj
T*
(     described in Section 3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2 ? UPTIME COMMITMENT) Tj
T*
(-------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1  Provider will make the Cloud Service available at least ninety-nine) Tj
T*
(     and one-half percent \(99.5%\) of the minutes in each calendar month, not) Tj
T*
(     counting Scheduled Maintenance \(the "Uptime Target"\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 3 ? SERVICE CREDITS) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.1  If the Monthly Uptime Percentage falls below the Uptime Target in any) Tj
T*
(     calendar month, Customer will be eligible for a Service Credit as) Tj
T*
(     specified in the table below:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(       Monthly Uptime Percentage          Service Credit) Tj
T*
(       ----------------------------       -------------------------) Tj
T*
(       99.0% to < 99.5%                   10% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
(       95.0% to < 99.0%                   25% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
(       Below 95.0%                        50% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(     "Monthly Fee" for the purpose of this SLA means the monthly Fee payable) Tj
T*
(     under the Agreement, currently Eight Thousand U.S. Dollars \($8,000.00\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.2  Credit Request Procedure. To receive a Service Credit, Customer must) Tj
